# Protects the server against link spam and botted server invites.

joins
within 3 messages; sends message containing "https://" and ".gg/"
kick and delete last 3 messages

sends message containing "https://"
less than 1 second later; sends message containing "https://"
less than 1 second later; sends message containing "https://"
timeout incremental and delete last 3 messages

sends message containing "http://"
less than 1 second later; sends message containing "http://"
timeout incremental and delete last 2 messages
